              "value": "The copper dragon breathes in one of two ways. The dragon can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n\u2022 Acid (acid, arcane, evocation); The dragon breathes acid in a 80-foot line that deals 13d6 acid damage (DC 32 basic Fortitude save).\n\u2022 Slowing Gas (arcane, transmutation); The dragon breathes a 80-foot line of slowing gas. Each creature in the area must succeed at a DC 32 Fortitude save or be slowed 1 for 1 round (or slowed 2 on a critical failure)."
            },
